<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 26.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 26.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 26     Sept 25	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  239.890     237.970     237.040    1.20 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.300     301.020     303.640   -0.77 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.680     157.900     165.490   -4.72 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.612	46.644	48.410   -3.71 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  373.980     372.260     366.280    2.10 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.550     140.770     147.886   -4.96 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.766	15.721	14.975    5.28 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.880     216.040     230.135   -5.76 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.875	 1.876	 1.939   -3.30 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.550	 1.550	 1.575   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.680     193.440     206.030   -6.97 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
